flowchart TD
    A[Define estimand and independent units] --> B[Authorize and version raw data]
    B --> C[Split groups before fitted transforms]
    C --> D[Reproduce strong baselines]
    D --> E[Paired ablations and uncertainty checks]
    E --> F{Pass real holdout and failure gates?}
    F -->|No| G[Reject / simplify / revise assumptions]
    G --> A
    F -->|Yes| H[Prospective protocol and human approval]
    H --> I[New real measurements]
    I --> J[Audit costs and external validity]
